---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-09-06';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy" description="Cookies and similar technologies that may be used on PetWellHub, with visitor controls">
  <article class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24"><header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-8"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent">Policy · Cookies</p><h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-bold md:text-7xl">Cookie Policy</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p></header>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
      <section><h2>What cookies are</h2><p>Cookies and similar browser storage are small records used to maintain preferences, measure site use, support security, or deliver advertising. A cookie does not give PetWellHub access to unrelated files on your device.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Essential and preference storage</h2><p>The site may store choices such as display preferences or consent status. Delivery and security providers may use short-lived identifiers to prevent abuse and keep the site available.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Analytics may process page views, referral information, device details, approximate location, and interaction events to show aggregate site use. The exact tools enabled can change with site configuration.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Advertising and affiliate measurement</h2><p>If advertising is enabled, Google or another disclosed provider may use cookies or similar identifiers to deliver, limit, and measure ads. Merchant or affiliate links may record referral information after a click. Manage Google ad personalization through <a class="underline" href="https://myadcenter.google.com/">My Ad Center</a>.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Your controls</h2><p>Browser settings can block, limit, or delete cookies. Privacy extensions and provider opt-out tools may offer additional controls. Blocking storage can disable saved preferences and does not necessarily prevent server security logs.</p></section>
      <section><h2>Contact and related policy</h2><p>See the <a class="underline" href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for broader data practices. Questions may be sent through the <a class="underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
